; The Preview button while a preview is being rendered: stops it.
MSG_BTN_STOP_PREVIEW (237//)
_Stop
;
; %s is a time in the edit, where the preview starts (the playhead).
MSG_STATUS_PREVIEW_FROM (238//)
Rendering a preview from %s...
;
; A preview is rendered in short pieces as it plays. %1 is how far it has
